{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_155","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented the G01 recovery contract in `src/lib/error-model.ts`:\n\n- Added `ERROR_RECOVERY` with a complete row for all 14 `AppErrorCode` values.\n- `retryable` is derived from `scope`; only self-retry classes are retryable and use exactly `{ kind: 'retry' }`.\n- `nextAction` is restricted to the five fixed verbs with only `kind` and optional bounded `target`.\n- `AppError` instances now expose `retryable` and `nextAction`; `UNKNOWN` has no action.\n- Reused the existing `AppError` / `HostResponse` governance boundary; no second envelope or error type.\n- Added focused tests, harness task spec, G01 evidence, acceptance JSON, and checksums.\n\n**Checks Run**\n- `node --experimental-strip-types` runtime assertions against `src/lib/error-model.ts`: PASS (14 classes).\n- `node harness/src/cli.mjs validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-error-recovery-next-action.md --no-diff`: PASS.\n- `node harness/src/cli.mjs context --spec ... --json`: PASS.\n- `node scripts/check-error-governance.mjs`: 14 checks PASS; one pre-existing failure because `tests/unit/error-governance-boundary.test.ts` is absent.\n- Credential-pattern scan of changed files: 0 findings.\n- `sha256sum -c docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/G01-SHA256SUMS`: all OK.\n\nVitest, typecheck, ESLint, comms replay/compare, and diff-aware harness dry-run were not run because `node_modules` and git metadata are absent, and dependency installation was prohibited.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"summary\": \"Implemented the G01 error recovery contract with a complete 14-code recovery table, scoped retryability, bounded non-executable next actions, AppError metadata, focused tests, harness spec, and acceptance evidence. Runtime and harness validation passed; dependency-backed gates were not runnable without installing dependencies.\",\n  \"testsRun\": [\n    \"node --experimental-strip-types runtime recovery assertions against src/lib/error-model.ts\",\n    \"node harness/src/cli.mjs validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-error-recovery-next-action.md --no-diff\",\n    \"node harness/src/cli.mjs context --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-error-recovery-next-action.md --json\",\n    \"node scripts/check-error-governance.mjs\",\n    \"sha256sum -c docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/G01-SHA256SUMS\"\n  ]\n}\n```"}}
